"Argaz-iw yemmut tmanya n wussan seg wass n zzwaǧ-nneɣ!" "Ihi, ur yenneɛtab ara aṭas!"
Steqsan afellaḥ acḥal n wulli i yesɛa. "Ur ẓriɣ. Yal tikkelt bdiɣ aḥsab, ṭṭseɣ."
Argaz iṛuḥ ɣer uqayed: "A ṭbib, ugur-iw d belli ulac win iselleɣ." Aqayed: "Win i d-iteddun!"
Argaz iṛuḥ ɣer usiraɣ n taẓẓut: "Acḥal taɣara n taẓẓut?" "Ula." "Ihi sers-iyi tabla teččuran!"
Argaz s wagṭaḍ ɣef uqerruy-is iṛuḥ ɣer uqayed. Agṭaḍ: "A ṭbib, uɣeɣ deg kra."
Adlis n uḥseb yenɣa iman-is... acuɣer? Axaṭer yesɛa aṭas n wuguren.
Aḥenzir imuqel afus n tafat yenna: "Anwa i k-yeḥbes deg wesɣar?"
Aṭbib n uslugen i wayeḍ: "Ihi, d acu-t udem i txeddmeḍ ass-a?"
Ayaziḍ yusa-d s tegla n rẓem ɣer tuxxfin-is: "A tullas, ur bɣiɣ ara ad ttrembleɣ, maca walit d acu xeddmen wid ijaharen."
Kecmen ɣer Adidas. D acu ixeddem ubulis? Ceggɛen tlata iberdiyen.
Amsal aqbur n Ccinwa: "Yal takaḍumt tettwaf deg-s teccubent."
Baba, baba, baba!!! Tessreḥeḍ-iyi ad walaɣ tiliẓri? Ih! Maca ur t-ssakkiḍ ara!
Baba, yella yiwen n wergaz ɣer tewwurt. Yenna yettjemmiɛ i dar imɣaren. Ah, d ayen ilhan. Efk-as jeddi.
A win yettwaḥekmen, bɣiɣ ad ẓreɣ - acuɣer i tettskerkiseḍ akka? "Axaṭer testeqsayeḍ aṭas, a Lḥakem."
Aselway n tuɣmas i umuḍin: "Tesriḍ tageldunt." Amuḍin: "Aql-i axir, yiwen yefhem-iyi."
Aẓmul n tissit: Werǧin sew ugâr n wayen tzemreḍ ad t-ssebleɛeḍ.
Ula deg cceṛq, medden selsen tiveṣṭat.
Tamɣart i mmi-s: "Tzemreḍ ad tessutreḍ seg-i adlis igerrzen." "Ihi ssutreɣ afaris-ik n usekles."
