Aselmed n tudert: ma yeɣli usffaḍ n uqerruy ɣer teɣbalt, d aɣur-ik aneggaru.
Lukas iceɛceɛ deg wexxam: "Aselmad-agi awessar! Yettmagg ɣef tira-inu, maca ukkuz-is ttcuban akked wisin!"
