Idrimen kan ur ẓewwrent ara i yiwen ad yili d amerẓaḍ. Ilaq ad ten-tesɛuḍ yakan.
Ayen ḥemmqen kan, Goethe yella d amedyaz.
Amdakel n uxeddim i wayeḍ: "D acu i tuɣ deg yigrawliwen? Nekni ur nxeddem ara ula d cci."
Asigna i wayeḍ: "Twalaḍ asigna ameqqran? Sɛiɣ acaḥeḥ ameqqran."
Amuḍin: "Ttergigiɣ aṭas. D ameslay-iw amenzu." Aṭbib: "Ur ttagad ara, ula d nekk."
Aẓmul akken ad t-ssalseḍ: Akk arrac rewlen i wemcic, maca Kim, i d-yeɣlin.
Asteqsi: D acu-t tikci igerrzen i ubudirar? Tiririt: Aḍris n tuɣalin. D acu tefkiḍ i uheddan?
Amsal: Elmed seg wesu. Ilaq-as ad yebḍu yal aḥenzir.
Nettat: "Nniɣ-ak, snat n tebrat n bira sakkin a d-tuɣaleḍ deg 10." Netta: "Ah, d ayagi i tebɣiḍ ad tiniḍ."
Amsizwer: "Ḥwaǧeɣ tuffaḥin i urgaz-iw, d wa yesɛa tissas n tira?" "Xaṭi, ilaq ad t-txedmeḍ s timmad-im."
Afellaḥ yenna i unebgi-s: "Deg berra, ayaziḍ ad k-issakker." "Igerrez, sers-it ɣef 11 zdat tazzelt!"
Aḥekkam isteqsi win yettwaḥekmen: "Anda tellid gar 3 akked 4?" "Deg tesnawt tamezwarut!" yerra.
