Snat n tebumbatin qqiment deg webaḥu. Yiwet tenna: "Kker, a nali ɣer ufella."
Snat n leklac-nsent ttlaqayent. Ey, sers-d afus!
Aman ittwafarnen d asteqsi ilaq ad d-ttwabegen.
Amek ara d-tsemmiḍ win yesnulfayen anagi n tuksa n kra? Anagi n tafat.
Amek ara d-tsemmiḍ amur amellal n tegla n taftilt? D taftilt daɣen!
D acu ixeddem apolonewi ɣef ugris? Ikkes.
D acu isɛeggu umsemselti mi yeɣli i wučči? Taɣma taḥerkalt.
D acu ixeddem uhekkam deg tesalatin? Ad yali.
D acu-t umatuc seg wadda n ttejra? Amkan yehded.
D acu yura ɣef weẓru n win ittsellixen? "Werǧin ad d-tuɣal."
D acu yura ɣef weẓru n uḥessab? "Ur t-yeḥsib ara."
D acu yura ɣef weẓru n win iqebbayen? "Yeffeɣ deg usfaylu."
D acu yura ɣef weẓru n win iqebbayen? "Tura ffɣeɣ deg usfaylu."
D acu yura ɣef weẓru n win yezgiren s webrid? "Deg webrid ɣur-k. Alamma d taggara."
D acu-t awal aneggaru n uselmad n tezzeɣt? "Akk isɣaren ɣur-i."
D acu ugâr n diri seg tegla deg tuffaḥt? Azgen n tegla deg tuffaḥt yettwaqecmen.
Acuɣer laẓwam d imeskerdiyen? Axaṭer twalaḍ srid seg-sen.
Acuɣer yerẓa uɣenja? Ɣef umkan.
Acuɣer eskimo yesɛan taɣzi n tudert taɣlant? Ur zmiren ara ad ɛeẓẓen aẓelmaḍ.
Acuɣer tayaziḍin ttarunt tigla? Anḍar ur yeddi ara. A tent-ṛuẓen.
Acuɣer taɣenjawt ur teldi ara? Axaṭer yella win yellan deg-s.
